    "detailed_description": "Neko Insufficient Firepower is a <strong>meat pigeon 2D tablet shooting game</strong>, a cat-themed game made in a hand-drawn comic style.<br>There are three kinds of weapons in the game that can be freely matched, and combined with weapon upgrades/random upgrade effects/talent effects/character skills/companion skills/bond skills/weapon dark matter (endless mode) to form a Build, which can realize various gameplays.<br>The game is currently divided into classic mode and endless mode.<br><strong>\u00b7Classic mode</strong>: There are 5 levels in total, each level carries a Boss, and it is divided into 4 levels of difficulty to challenge.<br><strong>\u00b7Endless Mode</strong>: It needs to be unlocked after clearing the classic mode with difficulty level 3 or above. There is no BOSS but there are new dark matter monsters, and dark matter modules can be dropped to customize and strengthen weapons. Dark matter monsters can randomly acquire a variety of skills.<br><br>At the same time, there are also cat fashions to dress up your cute cats and companions~<br><br><br>Welcome to join my discord and give me the advices!!",
